  <p id="c-liangshu-016-zhang-family-clauses:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-016-zhang-family-clauses:p001:m0000" ref="ant_dk4_dds">張稷</persName>字<persName id="c-liangshu-016-zhang-family-clauses:p001:m0003" ref="ant_dk4_dds">公喬</persName>，吳郡人也。父<persName id="c-liangshu-016-zhang-family-clauses:p001:m0012" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAAE">永</persName>，宋右光祿大夫。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-016-zhang-family-clauses:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-016-zhang-family-clauses:p002:m0000" ref="ant_dk4_dds">稷</persName>長女<persName id="c-liangshu-016-zhang-family-clauses:p002:m0003" ref="ant_dk4_dds_A">楚瑗</persName>，適會稽孔氏，無子歸宗。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-016-zhang-family-clauses:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-016-zhang-family-clauses:p003:m0000" ref="ant_dk4_dds">稷</persName>子<persName id="c-liangshu-016-zhang-family-clauses:p003:m0002" ref="ant_dk4_dds_B">嵊</persName>，別有傳。</p>
